    "Maintain your current back and chest volume — both are progressing well and the chest-to-back balance looks healthy. No major changes needed there, just keep executing."
  ],
  "contextSummary": "All six muscle groups improved this period with legs (+5), glutes (+4), and back (+4) leading; shoulders and core are mild imbalances to address by adding volume next period."
